    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horde Survival Arena + Deckbuilder, can that work? I think so, and i think this Game proves it.<br>Customize the Card Pool you get to build your Deck with and survive Hordes of Aliens, even stranger than you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One Possible Combo, might look like this:\u00a0 <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232320/extras/da1674aaab50f242495fdb8f666e502d.poster.avif?t=1743970812\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232320/extras/da1674aaab50f242495fdb8f666e502d.webm?t=1743970812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232320/extras/da1674aaab50f242495fdb8f666e502d.mp4?t=1743970812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Progression</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new Cards to Customize your Run-Deck</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new personalities, drasticly changing how to best build during the next Run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock even Higher Difficulties with more Aliens, more Rounds, more fun and more randomization (Bigger Cardpools)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In a Run</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy Short, action-packed Waves of 15-120 Seconds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level Up and Choose where to take your Basic Character stats from a Random Choice of 3 randomly Chosen Upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy Cards from the Shop between Rounds\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start of struggling for Survival</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become unstoppable or die trying</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In a Round</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn Xp and a Strange form of Currency by Destroying as Many Aliens as Possible</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Either Try to Survive, or go on a killing Spree</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your activatable Cards to either:</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permanently Scale your Characters Power</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Temporarily Get Big Powerboosts and Combos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or Unleash Devastating Special Attacks</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232320/extras/3cd807cbc7d7bf900b423fbefe8b57e6.poster.avif?t=1743970812\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232320/extras/3cd807cbc7d7bf900b423fbefe8b57e6.webm?t=1743970812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232320/extras/3cd807cbc7d7bf900b423fbefe8b57e6.mp4?t=1743970812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Between Runs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >unlock new Difficulties, Characters and Cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize the Pool of Cards the Shop can hold for you in the next run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check out your previous Runs and Compare your performance with your Friends</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proudly Powered by Godot Game Engine.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made in Germany</p>",
